00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:42,000
Krampus Origins is a horror film directed by Joseph Mbah.

3
00:12:54,000 --> 00:13:00,000
The first World War rages on when a group of American soldiers find a
mysterious artifact that can summon the ancient evil of the Krampus.

4
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:18,000
After the men are killed in action, the artifact is sent to the commanding
officer's widow who is a teacher at a small-town orphanage.

5
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:36,000
The orphans accidentally summon the Krampus and the teacher, and
her pupils are forced to battle this ancient evil.

6
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:54,000
Sister Rafus, played by Maria Olsen.

7
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:12,000
